And I don't think
those are aliens.

574
00:44:07,557 --> 00:44:09,995
Those are demons.
What do you think?

575
00:44:10,125 --> 00:44:11,474
I think your daddy should
have thought twice before

576
00:44:11,605 --> 00:44:13,085
he started banging his sister.

577
