What about the sensors?

757
00:58:41,953 --> 00:58:43,650
Stay close.

758
00:58:43,781 --> 00:58:45,913
Only go where I go.

759
00:58:50,831 --> 00:58:57,446
[tense music]

760
00:59:19,643 --> 00:59:27,128
[tense music]

761
